/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/reference/agent-api.md:473:Triggers compaction of the harness conversation immediately. Resolves as a no-op when there is nothing to compact; rejects when summarization fails or is aborted, and with `SessionBusyError` when another operation is in flight on the conversation. This compacts the harness's scratch conversation — the agent's main conversation compacts automatically per its [`CompactionConfig`](/docs/reference/agent-hooks-api/#compactionconfig).
