/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/sdk/flue-client.md-265-| `purpose`      | Stable semantic classification, independent of rendered text: `user` is public chat, `assistant` is an answer, `dispatch` is internal dispatch/control input, `advisory` is a runtime advisory. The union may widen as the runtime grows typed agent-activity signals.                                                                                       |
