/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/guide/schedules.md:135:A fixed id suits recurring work that builds on its own history — the agent can compare today against yesterday without re-fetching it. Per-fire ids suit independent runs where an ever-growing transcript is a cost, and they leave each run individually inspectable.
