/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/guide/cloudflare-target.md:28:Your project's `wrangler.jsonc` at the project root configures your Worker's name, compatibility settings, and Durable Object migrations. Flue reads this file, merges its contributions (`main` and the per-agent Durable Object bindings) into a generated `.flue-vite.wrangler.jsonc` that the Cloudflare Vite plugin consumes, and never modifies your authored file. Add `.flue-vite/` and `.flue-vite.wrangler.jsonc` to `.gitignore`.
