/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/guide/migration.md-336-3. **Routing.** Author explicit mounts in `app.ts`; delete `flue()` router usage; mount each channel's `route()`; decide which agents are dispatch-only.
/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/guide/migration.md:337:4. **Agents.** Convert each initializer to an exported capitalized agent function in a `'use agent'` module: hooks for behavior, statics (`agentName`, `initialData`, `durability`) for the contract, `AgentProps` for the id, platform env instead of `ctx.env`. Convert profiles to `useSubagent` agent functions. Agents that used the implicit virtual sandbox declare one: `useSandbox(bash(() => new Bash({ fs: new InMemoryFs() })))`.
/home/ubuntu/.npm/_npx/8cba94e94504a6dc/node_modules/@flue/runtime/docs/guide/migration.md-338-5. **Tools.** Rename `run({ input })` to `run({ data })`; adopt `harness: true` where tools prompted sessions; consider `durable: true` for side-effect sequences.
