-declarative agent composition; accepted-work durability contract (submissions/attempts/settlement/
-converge-then-classify/at-least-once-over-exactly-once); frozen prompt + capability signals; runtime
-event stream with observe(); persistence adapter contract + contract test suites; opaque cursors and a
